if SHIELD_ESB_NAPE_TOUCHTEST

# Touch bring-up test variant layered on esb_nape_disptest: no
# Kconfig changes of its own. The devicetree changes (dummy PAW3222
# sensor and its SPI1 bus disabled and the dummy kscan parked on
# P1.03, so the parked pins of the disptest layer can no longer
# hold a touch line in reset; hardware I2C0 moved to the confirmed
# harness pins P1.02/P1.04; cst816s rst-gpios on P0.03 so the
# driver pulses TP_RST itself) live in esb_nape_touchtest.overlay,
# the LVGL button widget is enabled via esb_nape_touchtest.conf,
# and the test app (hardware I2C scan cross-check + tap screen) is
# src/touch_test.c. Keyboard name etc. still come from esb_nape_rx.

endif
